      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "When the Chicago & Port Huron Railroad opened, residents moved the entire town to the tracks, hoping for a depot, but officials only stopped at the first village that built one.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        8,
        9,
        10,
